{"data":[{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2076344667097227669","created_at":"2026-07-12T16:35:19.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2076344667097227669"],"id":"2076344667097227669","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":5722,"like_count":115,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":18},"text":"真正的道歉是改变和补偿 语言上的道歉不过是苦肉计不值得被原谅","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2076344667097227669"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2076342181447831984","created_at":"2026-07-12T16:25:27.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2076342181447831984"],"id":"2076342181447831984","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":4312,"like_count":57,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":6},"text":"后来我想留住每一个在我身边的人","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2076342181447831984"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2076257170610651148","created_at":"2026-07-12T10:47:39.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2076257170610651148"],"id":"2076257170610651148","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":7639,"like_count":36,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":31,"retweet_count":1},"text":"不是色情消息和游戏邀约别发","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2076257170610651148"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2076027780551356814","created_at":"2026-07-11T19:36:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2076027780551356814"],"id":"2076027780551356814","lang":"zh","note_tweet":{"text":"爱变成迷恋之前一定会有巨大的恨，如果只有爱是没办法铭记某人的。\n爱一定要掺着滔天的恨和痛苦才好看，才让人记忆深刻。迷恋是痴狂，是不舍，是难忘。是我知道你和我不同路，但我非要和你走。\n我爱你爱过我，也爱你自我。甚至连你将我放弃时的那副冷漠和决绝的样子都一并爱了我告诉我自己我恨你，于是我更爱你了。"},"public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":12,"impression_count":6834,"like_count":151,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":18,"retweet_count":20},"text":"爱变成迷恋之前一定会有巨大的恨，如果只有爱是没办法铭记某人的。\n爱一定要掺着滔天的恨和痛苦才好看，才让人记忆深刻。迷恋是痴狂，是不舍，是难忘。是我知道你和我不同路，但我非要和你走。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2076027780551356814"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2076027343962099799","created_at":"2026-07-11T19:34:24.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2076027343962099799"],"id":"2076027343962099799","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":3042,"like_count":25,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":2},"text":"至少你以前不是这样的","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2076027343962099799"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2076019825034534968","created_at":"2026-07-11T19:04:31.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2076019825034534968"],"id":"2076019825034534968","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":3629,"like_count":48,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":3},"text":"人 你需要到此为止的勇气","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2076019825034534968"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2076019260808392770","created_at":"2026-07-11T19:02:17.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2076019260808392770"],"id":"2076019260808392770","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":22,"impression_count":43221,"like_count":576,"quote_count":15,"reply_count":34,"retweet_count":116},"text":"所以反复咀嚼痛苦让你幸福了吗","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2076019260808392770"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2075649667317346389","created_at":"2026-07-10T18:33:39.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2075649667317346389"],"id":"2075649667317346389","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":15,"impression_count":8526,"like_count":168,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":10,"retweet_count":24},"text":"我们跳过那些虚张声势的试探吧，你告诉我你也想要长久安心的关系，我就愿意付出一切。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2075649667317346389"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2075243180271014376","created_at":"2026-07-09T15:38:24.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2075243180271014376"],"id":"2075243180271014376","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":7,"impression_count":5454,"like_count":89,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":13},"text":"有一个想操的人真的太重要了，在你打算稀里糊涂过这普普通通的一生的时候，会因为对方而想再努力一下，在那么多疲惫不堪甚至抬不起头的日子，会因为对方的逼而觉得人生还有盼头必须得去撸一发","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2075243180271014376"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2075227308089299268","created_at":"2026-07-09T14:35:20.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2075227308089299268"],"id":"2075227308089299268","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":10,"impression_count":12550,"like_count":258,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":30,"retweet_count":43},"text":"人在幸福时会有一种很柔软的难过。\n那一刻明明什么都没发生，心里却像被什么东西轻轻揪了一下。\n你突然意识到，这一秒正在变成上一秒。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2075227308089299268"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2075134176014291301","created_at":"2026-07-09T08:25:16.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2075134176014291301"],"id":"2075134176014291301","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":3675,"like_count":46,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":11,"retweet_count":5},"text":"为什么艺术很美 因为毫无用处 为什么生活丑态百出 因为全是目的和企图","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2075134176014291301"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2075125942079594832","created_at":"2026-07-09T07:52:33.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2075125942079594832"],"id":"2075125942079594832","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3362,"like_count":33,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":11,"retweet_count":5},"text":"所有实在没什么意思，对痛苦的感知也明显薄弱。只能躺在狼藉中，让意识在时间中漫无目的摇晃。\n总在想，我现在是已经可以死掉的状态了吧？但是好像什么苦也没吃到，什么恩也尚未去报，这个好事不会允许我发生。\n于是我又重新躺回狼藉里，静静等待正义，等待审判","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2075125942079594832"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2075038655035715833","created_at":"2026-07-09T02:05:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2075038655035715833"],"id":"2075038655035715833","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":3496,"like_count":46,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":12,"retweet_count":7},"text":"遺憾能记好久 仇恨也能记好久 只有幸\n福的感觉转瞬即逝","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2075038655035715833"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2074903094379639216","created_at":"2026-07-08T17:07:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2074903094379639216"],"id":"2074903094379639216","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":3408,"like_count":35,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":11,"retweet_count":2},"text":"我在乎和不在乎又怎样呢，只是表露出来让你感受的到我在爱你，也就只有这样了。如果你需要，我也可以演。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2074903094379639216"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2074901968603242533","created_at":"2026-07-08T17:02:33.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2074901968603242533"],"id":"2074901968603242533","lang":"zh","note_tweet":{"text":"好累，累得像明天早上七点钟要打卡上月薪3000的班，最近和老婆感情不和，特意从药店花500块买来十版伟哥，三片三片地吃，发现其中250都是奶片，只好把所有的一个个吃过去，好不容易勃起，结果老婆进门，说她爱上别人了，给我递来离婚协议后拉走了行李箱。我看着自己的鸡鸡、地上的药盒，和窗外凌晨五点的夜色，静静地想，怎么办，如果不去医院治疗，我会死，但如果去医院，我就没有全勤奖金了。"},"public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":10696,"like_count":34,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":19,"retweet_count":3},"text":"好累，累得像明天早上七点钟要打卡上月薪3000的班，最近和老婆感情不和，特意从药店花500块买来十版伟哥，三片三片地吃，发现其中250都是奶片，只好把所有的一个个吃过去，好不容易勃起，结果老婆进门，说她爱上别人了，给我递来离婚协议后拉走了行李箱。我看着自己的鸡鸡、地上的药盒，和窗外凌晨五点","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2074901968603242533"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2074900363522842948","created_at":"2026-07-08T16:56:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2074900363522842948"],"id":"2074900363522842948","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":7,"impression_count":6593,"like_count":125,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":23,"retweet_count":17},"text":"一个重视你的人 永远不会把自己置于可能导致失去你的境地","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2074900363522842948"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2074891608454201732","created_at":"2026-07-08T16:21:23.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2074891608454201732"],"id":"2074891608454201732","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":9269,"like_count":46,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":23,"retweet_count":1},"text":"不跟前任断联到底要怎样走进下一段感情","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2074891608454201732"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2074891302135808067","created_at":"2026-07-08T16:20:10.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2074891302135808067"],"id":"2074891302135808067","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":4131,"like_count":33,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":10},"text":"短痛太痛了 如果你真的需要一个人的爱来帮你走出创伤的话也先选择我吧 我有无尽的真心用来给你浪费","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2074891302135808067"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2074890621186342932","created_at":"2026-07-08T16:17:28.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2074890621186342932"],"id":"2074890621186342932","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":3238,"like_count":29,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":4},"text":"我一天要抽出一小部分的时间去想你，想那些已经逝去的流年，然后剩下的大部分时间里在发呆。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2074890621186342932"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2074890344433644007","created_at":"2026-07-08T16:16:22.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2074890344433644007"],"id":"2074890344433644007","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3635,"like_count":35,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":10},"text":"好想把现在所拥有的一切幸福都丢掉然后去死","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2074890344433644007"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2074890005496148232","created_at":"2026-07-08T16:15:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2074890005496148232"],"id":"2074890005496148232","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2660,"like_count":28,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":9,"retweet_count":2},"text":"我单箭头的历史太厚了，所以太清楚注视着某个人、又想被某个人看见的人们有着怎样一双眼睛，不管是从中看到自己的倒影，还是单纯看着这双眼睛却爱莫能助的心情，都太凄苦了","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2074890005496148232"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2074883149583229090","created_at":"2026-07-08T15:47:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2074883149583229090"],"id":"2074883149583229090","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2958,"like_count":15,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":12,"retweet_count":1},"text":"从我出生就不是一个富二代开始，我对这个世界就没什么好说的","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2074883149583229090"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2074881697976582228","created_at":"2026-07-08T15:42:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2074881697976582228"],"id":"2074881697976582228","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":4517,"like_count":75,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":10,"retweet_count":6},"text":"人生就是要选择自己想要忍受的痛苦，或者能够忍受的痛苦，然后在痛苦带来的细微欢愉中走完这一生。","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2074881697976582228"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2074881102414807391","created_at":"2026-07-08T15:39:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2074881102414807391"],"id":"2074881102414807391","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":2621,"like_count":36,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":5},"text":"我的大脑每时每刻都有超多的想法冒出来，而且不是我能控制的。所以我必须要写作，必须要把这些好的坏的想法倾吐出来，不然就会被乱七八糟的想法反噬。那些想法就会像苍蝇那样在我脑袋里嗡嗡作响，吵得我内心无法安宁，引起我的焦虑和恐慌。所以必须把这些想法释放出去，清空内心的垃圾，回归心灵的平静","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2074881102414807391"},{"author_id":"1917047326990094336","conversation_id":"2074879936507363657","created_at":"2026-07-08T15:35:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2074879936507363657"],"id":"2074879936507363657","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":4631,"like_count":78,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":14},"text":"我最大的幸福就是安静地听你讲话","url":"https://x.com/0TwT012/status/2074879936507363657"}],"includes":{"users":[{"id":"1917047326990094336","name":"kiri","profile_image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1917047544313679872/akAJkXe1_normal.jpg","username":"0TwT012","verified":false}]},"meta":{"newest_id":"2076344667097227669","next_token":"b26v89c19zqg8o3juethkp0tghhtq9cly70io3nj5uhrx","oldest_id":"2074879936507363657","result_count":25}}